desc:AmbiX FOA to stereo (Walk-To-Novotel)
// First-order AmbiX (ACN, SN3D) frontal-stage to stereo.
// Input pins: 1=W omni, 2=Y left(+)/right, 3=Z up, 4=X front.
// Classic mid-side decode plus a light center fill from X.
// This is a monitor fold-down, not HRTF binaural: for true headphone
// 3D, install IEM BinauralDecoder and put it after this (bypass this).

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
in_pin:z input
in_pin:x input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

slider1:1<0,2,0.01>output trim

@sample
  w = spl0;
  y = spl1;
  x = spl3;
  l = 0.5 * (w + y) + 0.25 * x;
  r = 0.5 * (w - y) + 0.25 * x;
  spl0 = l * slider1;
  spl1 = r * slider1;
